  dialogueText: "When asking someone to hand you an object, you can use 'ikanmo man...'\nIt
    means 'give me...' and you add the item you want afterward.\nFor example: 'ikanmo
    man map' \u2014 'give me the map.'\nListen carefully: ikanmo man map.\nNow, try
    saying 'ikanmo man' followed by an object you want."
